{"id":"yia6kqugzp60xrcab7dfi8hm1","title":"庞加莱对奥斯卡二世皇家悬赏的回应及其对经典力学确定性宇宙观的颠覆","originalTitle":"万有引力和三体（2）","summary":"庞加莱在 1887 年奥斯卡二世皇家悬赏中提交论文，证明三体及多体系统存在初始条件敏感的混沌效应，彻底颠覆牛顿-拉普拉斯的确定性宇宙观。该研究引发后续数值模拟热潮，包括 Sussman & Wisdom 在《Science》通过辛积分验证混沌特性（1992），以及 Jose 在《Astronomical Journal》建立太阳质心运动准周期模型（1965）。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=39359&do=blog&id=1560073"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T01:18:44.311Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T01:18:44.311Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":67,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}